From: Gerald Spencer <contact@geraldhspencer.com>
Date: Fri, 17 Jul 2026 17:31:10 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] feat: allow dependency modules to annotate crate repositories

---
 rs/extensions.bzl               | 11 +++----
 rs/private/BUILD.bazel          | 12 ++++++++
 rs/private/annotations.bzl      | 21 +++++++------
 rs/private/annotations_test.bzl | 54 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 81 insertions(+), 17 deletions(-)
